                   <p>如果工作需要，或者新区爱好还是可以的。<br>如果只是为了卷而啃，那确实没啥必要了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18141724\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/b034856a32b8404d6826d471fe7b7659?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"myTrip\" data-uid=\"705085\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/myTrip\">myTrip</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 14:16:16 +08:00\">20h 24m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>仿佛有用，仿佛又没用，总而言之还是有必要</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18141747\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/022e/17ea/39164_normal.png?m=1646214419\" alt=\"bzw875\" data-uid=\"39164\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/bzw875\">bzw875</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 14:21:48 +08:00\">20h 18m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>AI 时代已经打断了人才培养渠道。企业只需要高级人才，但是企业使用 AI 来替代中低端人才。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18141813\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f0f5/2aef/509533_normal.png?m=1776749555\" alt=\"20200924\" data-uid=\"509533\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/20200924\">20200924</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 14:34:30 +08:00\">20h 5m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>当机器人都能干的时候，赚钱都没用了，要什么发什么，我是感觉总有这一天</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18141981\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/acd6/85e6/497030_normal.png?m=1783483367\" alt=\"WaldenHorizon\" data-uid=\"497030\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/WaldenHorizon\">WaldenHorizon</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 15:08:14 +08:00\">19h 32m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>可以从更高的抽象层面了解一下，实际需要时再进入细节学习<br>但也都建议用 AI 对话学习，放弃书本</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18142033\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/396c65adceaa3d315f5710b90343b977?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"datocp\" data-uid=\"93383\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/datocp\">datocp</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 15:18:35 +08:00\">19h 21m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>真的有人什么都不懂，就能问 AI 做出一个成品?<br>AI 这家伙次次回答的不一样，没有相关经验的人凭什么提出问题。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18142057\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1f62/a71b/341567_normal.png?m=1534382851\" alt=\"xtreme1\" data-uid=\"341567\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xtreme1\">xtreme1</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 15:24:37 +08:00\">19h 15m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>就事论事, csapp 看起来像本字典似的, 其实没讲多少东西</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18142090\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6403/2936/394980_normal.png?m=1606816349\" alt=\"shawnsh\" data-uid=\"394980\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/shawnsh\">shawnsh</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 15:31:29 +08:00\">19h 8m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>看你目的了，知道底层技术又不能升职加薪，用到了再看，计算机方向太多了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18142200\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c6de940881d279ce8e0ed89903c02431?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"benjor\" data-uid=\"712786\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/benjor\">benjor</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 15:58:13 +08:00\">18h 42m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这本书值得花时间读。它打通了“程序如何在单机上真正运行”这条主干——从数据表示、汇编、处理器到缓存、虚拟内存和并发，为理解各种新软硬件打下了底层知识框架。AI 时代，未必需要亲自把每件事做到极致，但需要底层的判断力：知道什么是好、什么是对的，才能指挥 AI 去做、去验证。这本书提供的正是这种判断力的思路和基础。当然，读完它要投入相当的精力与时间，部分章节(如处理器流水线、虚拟内存)还需要一定的技术储备才能真正读懂</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18142260\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f178/a1b8/133660_normal.png?m=1789607756\" alt=\"Haku\" data-uid=\"133660\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Haku\">Haku</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 16:08:06 +08:00\">18h 32m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>和汇编一样，有必要了解，以及小幅度的实操一下，但是没必要上手用</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18142776\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5765a702fda4ba24599890b4c40cc2de?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"charlie21\" data-uid=\"112645\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/charlie21\">charlie21</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 18:19:28 +08:00\">16h 20m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>llm 是代码生成器而已 codegen ，主要提供一些代码模板和代码规范 外加一点点封装好的十分表面的业务逻辑，这玩意从 1990 年代就有了。也没见过谁为此而自废武功啊</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18142855\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7121/0eb9/222090_normal.png?m=1789119518\" alt=\"iorilu\" data-uid=\"222090\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/iorilu\">iorilu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 19:04:42 +08:00\">15h 35m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>看你想干啥</p><p>如果只是为了工作没必要</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18143170\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a0a7da8499cec0f24992d81473febeb9?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"z97s04\" data-uid=\"53178\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/z97s04\">z97s04</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 22:56:53 +08:00\">11h 43m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我已经不会写代码了基本上</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18143242\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3f06/6f8f/401678_normal.png?m=1770468392\" alt=\"levelworm\" data-uid=\"401678\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/levelworm\">levelworm</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 23:51:05 +08:00\">10h 49m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>有兴趣或者工作的确需要就弄，否则真的没用。我自己琢磨过一点，但是因为没啥用的地方，只是自己想琢磨，一方面没过多久就忘记了，另一方面琢磨其实也琢磨不深，因为很多东西都是生产环境有所需要才产生的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18143343\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/efe3e3240b4e0011ca8376aee28af199?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"cvbnt\" data-uid=\"100968\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cvbnt\">cvbnt</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-01 03:07:14 +08:00\">7h 33m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你如果想靠这个赚钱，那方向错了，如果是兴趣或工作需要，可以看看</p>\n 